        {
          "content": "<p>深圳罗湖区翠竹外国语学校，地处闹市。为了给学生增加活动面积，将屋顶建成梯田式的操场和绿地。（<a href=\"https://www.archdaily.cn/cn/1031508/cui-zhu-wai-guo-yu-xue-xiao-link-arcjian-zhu-shi-wu-suo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">via</a>）</p>",
          "links": [
            {
              "text": "via",
              "url": "https://www.archdaily.cn/cn/1031508/cui-zhu-wai-guo-yu-xue-xiao-link-arcjian-zhu-shi-wu-suo"
