          "title": "本",
          "content": "<p>周，特斯拉在好莱坞推出了第一家“<a href=\"https://www.koc.com.tw/archives/607489\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">特斯拉餐厅</a>”。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202507/bg2025072412.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>他们的目标是，这种餐厅将成为特斯拉超级充电站的标配，让客户一边充电一边用餐。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202507/bg2025072413.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>客户可以进餐厅用餐，也可以不下车，等待店员送餐，并在停车场看露天电影。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202507/bg2025072414.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>该餐厅所有汉堡的纸盒，都是 CyberTruck 的纸模型。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202507/bg2025072415.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202507/bg2025072416.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>",
